# FKS Stack and Layers

- **Stack:** Electron, TypeScript, WebGPU, React (UI only), D3, IndexedDB. No proprietary SDKs, no cloud lock-in.
- **Semantic (meaning, no pixels):** similarity, force params, lens, search.
- **Render (perception, no meaning):** WebGPU, shaders, LOD, viewport, culling.
- **Interaction (intent; reshapes semantics):** input, focus, selection, drag; controls force and viewport.
